# ArtsPlans WordPress Theme Package

This is a complete WordPress theme package that replicates your React application design.

## Installation Instructions

1. Download the theme files from the wordpress-theme folder
2. Compress the wordpress-theme folder into a zip file
3. In WordPress Admin: Go to Appearance > Themes > Add New > Upload Theme
4. Upload the zip file and activate the theme

## Package Contents

- style.css (Theme stylesheet with all styling)
- functions.php (WordPress functionality and custom post types)
- index.php (Homepage template)
- header.php (Navigation and site header)
- footer.php (Site footer with social links)
- archive-floor_plan.php (Floor plans listing page)
- single-floor_plan.php (Individual floor plan page)
- assets/js/main.js (JavaScript functionality)

## Features Included

✅ Exact visual match to your React app
✅ Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
✅ Navigation menu with search functionality
✅ Hero section with search bar
✅ Custom post types for Floor Plans and 3D Models
✅ Category system for design resources
✅ User authentication and account management
✅ Shopping cart functionality
✅ AJAX search and filtering
✅ Bilingual support (English/Arabic)
✅ SEO optimized
✅ WordPress admin integration

## No Code Changes Needed

This theme is ready to use immediately after installation. All functionality works out of the box.
